# Build context for THIS Dockerfile only.
#
# BuildKit looks for `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore` before falling back to the context root's
# `.dockerignore`, so this file governs `.devcontainer/agent_confined/Dockerfile` and the operator profile's
# build is unaffected. It REPLACES the root file rather than merging with it, which is why the root's entries
# are repeated at the bottom.
#
# WHY IT EXISTS. Measured on the first build, 2026-08-22: the context was **11.68 GB**, 83 s to transfer and
# a further 120 s to COPY — before a single package was installed. Almost none of it is needed, because the
# COPY exists for exactly one purpose: to give `scripts/install-prerequisites.sh` a tree to run against. The
# real working tree arrives at run time through the bind mount, so anything the INSTALLER does not read is
# pure cost.
#
# What the installer actually reads (checked against the script, 2026-08-22):
#   * scripts/install-prerequisites.sh itself
#   * src/tui/package.json and the TypeScript sources — `bun install && bun run build`
# and that is all. Note in particular that it does NOT use the in-tree `ailang/`: `install_ailang()` clones
# github.com/sunholo-data/ailang at its pinned tag into ~/.local/share/ailang and builds from there.
#
# This is a DENYLIST of the large directories rather than an allowlist, on purpose: an allowlist that misses
# something the installer reads fails the build in a way that looks like a script bug. If the installer ever
# grows a new in-tree dependency, the worst this file does is make the build slower.

# --- caches and toolchain checkouts: rebuilt or refetched inside the image ---------------------------------
.ailang/
.emsdk/
.pnpm-store/
.venv-litellm/
.venv-marimo/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/

# --- runtime state, none of it a build input ---------------------------------------------------------------
.motoko/
.motoko-store/
.omp/
.remarkable/

# --- large in-tree checkouts and artefacts. Every one of these is present at RUN time through the bind
#     mount; the installer does not read any of them.
ailang/
deepseek-harness/
code-graph/
tools/
benchmarks/
papers/
experiments/
web/
omnigraph/
assets/
design_docs/
examples/
ext/
scratchpad/

# --- the root .dockerignore's entries, repeated because this file replaces rather than extends it ----------
.git
.packages
src/tui/node_modules
src/tui/dist
node_modules
dist
coverage
tmp
*.tmp
.DS_Store
